---
title: ":sweet_potato: Crispy BBQ Sweet Potatoes"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 8 minutes
total time: 20 minutes
tags:
  - sides
  - potatoes
  - sweet-potato
  - grilling
  - bbq
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

Spray #grill grates{} with nonstick spray; prepare grill for medium-hot fire.

In a #small bowl{}, combine @ketchup{3%Tbsp}, @vegetarian Worcestershire sauce{1%Tbsp}, @red wine vinegar{1%Tbsp}, @prepared mustard{1%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}.

Brush mixture onto peeled and cut @sweet potatoes{1%lb} (sliced into 1/4-inch slices).

Grill sweet potato slices, turning frequently and brushing with remaining ketchup mixture until crispy and tender, about ~{8%minutes}.
